<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Princess Day!</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffccff, #ffffff);
            color: #333;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 0;
            overflow: hidden; /* For floating hearts */
        }
        nav {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        nav a {
            margin: 0 15px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #ff1493;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: color 0.3s;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        nav a:hover, nav a.active {
            color: #ff69b4;
        }
        .page {
            display: none; /* Hide all pages by default */
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease-in;
        }
        .page.show {
            display: block;
        }
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        /* Home-specific styles */
        #home h1 {
            font-size: 3em;
            color: #ff1493;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.05); }
        }
        .heart {
            font-size: 2em;
            color: #ff69b4;
            animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
        }
        .sparkle {
            animation: sparkle 2s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes sparkle {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.5; }
        }
        /* About-specific styles */
        #about h1 {
            color: #ff1493;
            animation: bounce 2s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 20%, 50%, 80%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            40% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
            60% { transform: translateY(-5px); }
        }
        .hearts {
            font-size: 2em;
            color: #ff69b4;
            animation: pulseHearts 1.5s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulseHearts {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.2); }
        }
        /* Gallery-specific styles */
        .gallery {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .gallery img {
            width: 200px;
            height: 200px;
            margin: 10px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        }
        .gallery img:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 20, 147, 0.5);
            animation: sparkleHover 1s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes sparkleHover {
            0%, 100% { filter: brightness(1); }
            50% { filter: brightness(1.5); }
        }
        /* Surprise-specific styles */
        #surprise h1 {
            color: #ff1493;
            animation: wiggle 1s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes wiggle {
            0%, 100% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            25% { transform: rotate(-3deg); }
            75% { transform: rotate(3deg); }
        }
        .gift {
            font-size: 3em;
            color: #ff69b4;
            animation: bounceGift 2s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes bounceGift {
            0%, 20%, 50%, 80%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            40% { transform: translateY(-20px); }
            60% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
        }
        .message {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav>
        <a href="#" onclick="showPage('home')" class="active">Home</a> |
        <a href="#" onclick="showPage('about')">About Us</a> |
        <a href="#" onclick="showPage('gallery')">Gallery</a> |
        <a href="#" onclick="showPage('surprise')">Surprise</a>
    </nav>

    <!-- Home Page -->
    <div id="home" class="page show">
        <h1>Happy Princess Day, My Love! <span class="heart">❤️</span></h1>
        <p class="message">
            My dearest princess, you're the sparkle in my crown and the magic in my heart. <span class="sparkle">✨</span><br>
            On this special day, I celebrate you the one who turns ordinary moments into fairy tales. I love your smile, your laugh, and how you make me feel like the luckiest prince alive!<br>
            Here's to endless adventures, sweet kisses, and a lifetime of "happily ever after." You're my everything! 💕
        </p>
        <p class="message">
            Let's make more magic together darlingggggg!
        </p>
        <p>Forever yours,<br>Your khadus 😂😚😚💗</p>
    </div>

    <!-- About Us Page -->
    <div id="about" class="page">
        <h1>About Us <span class="hearts">💖💕</span></h1>
        <p class="message">
            Once upon a time, a prince met his perfect princess at school  From that moment, our story became a whirlwind of love, laughter, and little adventures.<br>
            You're my best friend, my confidant, and the one who makes my world brighter. Happy Princess Day may you always shine! 👑<br>
            Cute fact: You have the cutest giggle, and it melts my heart every time. <span class="hearts">❤️</span><br>
            Can't wait for our next chapter filled with more romance and dreams come true!
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Gallery Page -->
    <div id="gallery" class="page">
        <h1>Our Magical Moments ✨</h1>
        <p class="message">
            Look at these treasures from our fairy tale! Each photo reminds me of your beauty and our unbreakable bond.<br>
            You're my princess, my love, my forever. Hover over the pics for extra sparkle just like you! 💖<br>
            Happy Princess Day let's capture a million more memories!
        </p>
        <div class="gallery">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/200x200/ff69b4/ffffff?text=Our+First+Date" alt="First Date">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/200x200/ff1493/ffffff?text=Princess+Picnic" alt="Picnic">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/200x200/pink/ffffff?text=Adventure+Day" alt="Adventure">
            <!-- Replace with real image URLs -->
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Surprise Page -->
    <div id="surprise" class="page">
        <h1>Surprise! 🎉</h1>
        <p class="message">
            Ta-da! You've found the hidden treasure. As your devoted prince, I'm showering you with virtual gifts: a crown, endless hugs, thousand of kisses and a promise that i will never leave you alone my small cutie!<br>
            You're the most adorable princess ever your smile lights up my world. Happy Princess Day, my love! Let's keep the magic going. 👑💕<br>
            
            I loveeeeeeeeee youuuuuhhhhhhhhhhh babyyyy 💗💗💗😚😚
        </p>
        <div class="gift">👑✨🎁💖</div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function showPage(pageId) {
            // Hide all pages
            const pages = document.querySelectorAll('.page');
            pages.forEach(page => page.classList.remove('show'));
            
            // Show the selected page
            document.getElementById(pageId).classList.add('show');
            
            // Update active nav link
            const links = document.querySelectorAll('nav a');
            links.forEach(link => link.classList.remove('active'));
            event.target.classList.add('active');
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
